"The current Web Owner password was created before recoverable local credentials were enabled. Reset the Owner password to make it available in this App." = "当前控制台管理员密码创建于本机可恢复凭据功能启用之前，因此无法读取。请在此重设管理员密码，之后即可在 App 中查看和复制。";
