"This Owner account predates recoverable machine-local credentials. Its current password cannot be revealed. Reset the Owner password here to create a new locally stored credential." = "此管理员账户早于本机可恢复凭据功能创建，当前密码无法显示。请在此重设管理员密码，以创建新的本机安全凭据。";
"All Web Owner sessions were revoked." = "所有控制台管理员会话已撤销。";
