"Machine API token copied to the clipboard for 60 seconds." = "机器 API 令牌已复制到剪贴板，并将在 60 秒后自动清除。";
"Rotate Machine API Token?" = "轮换机器 API 令牌？";
"Existing machine API clients using the current token will stop authenticating after the new token takes effect. Running ChatCockpit services will restart; stopped services remain stopped and use the new token on their next start. Web Owner and ChatGPT OAuth sessions are separate and are not changed." = "新令牌生效后，仍使用当前令牌的机器 API 客户端将无法继续认证。正在运行的 ChatCockpit 服务会重启；已停止的服务保持停止，并在下次启动时使用新令牌。控制台管理员与 ChatGPT OAuth 属于独立权限，不会受到影响。";
"Rotate Token" = "轮换令牌";
"Machine API token rotated and running services restarted. The new token is shown temporarily; update machine clients that use it." = "机器 API 令牌已轮换，正在运行的服务已重启。新令牌会临时显示，请同步更新仍在使用机器 API 令牌的客户端。";
"Machine API token rotated. Stopped services remain stopped and will use the new token on their next start." = "机器 API 令牌已轮换。已停止的服务保持停止，并会在下次启动时使用新令牌。";
"Machine API token could not be rotated." = "无法轮换机器 API 令牌。";
"Security settings could not be read from the local ChatCockpit runtime." = "无法从本机 ChatCockpit 运行环境读取安全设置。";
"Web Owner sessions, machine API credentials, and ChatGPT OAuth are separate authorities. Token reveal is temporary and stays in memory only. Rotating the machine token restarts services only when they are already running; stopped services stay stopped. Web Owner and ChatGPT OAuth sessions are not revoked." = "控制台管理员会话、机器 API 凭据与 ChatGPT OAuth 是三套独立权限。令牌明文只会临时驻留内存；轮换机器令牌只会在服务原本处于运行状态时重启服务，已停止的服务会保持停止。控制台管理员与 ChatGPT OAuth 会话不会被撤销。";
