"The secure login entry gates new unauthenticated Web sign-ins; it never replaces authentication. Existing signed-in sessions continue to use the stable /ui/ Cockpit. Trusted LAN CIDRs are a network admission gate only, and allowed LAN devices must still authenticate." = "安全登录入口只用于限制新的未认证 Web 登录，不能替代身份认证。已经登录的会话继续使用稳定的 /ui/ 控制台。可信局域网 CIDR 也只负责网络准入，允许的局域网设备仍必须完成身份认证。";
"Access policy updated and running services restarted." = "访问策略已更新，正在运行的服务已重启并应用新策略。";
"Access policy updated. Stopped services remain stopped." = "访问策略已更新；当前已停止的服务保持停止。";
"Access policy could not be updated. Check the secure login entry and LAN CIDR values." = "无法更新访问策略，请检查安全登录入口与局域网 CIDR。";
"Apply Access Policy and Restart Services?" = "应用访问策略并重启服务？";
"The new secure login entry and network admission policy take effect after the Control Plane restarts. Existing signed-in /ui/ sessions remain valid. Running ChatCockpit services will restart now; stopped services are never started automatically." = "新的安全登录入口与网络准入策略需要在控制平面重启后生效。已经登录的 /ui/ 会话仍然有效。当前正在运行的 ChatCockpit 服务将立即重启；已停止的服务绝不会被自动启动。";
"Apply and Restart" = "应用并重启";
"Local passwordless sign-in was unavailable, so ChatCockpit opened the normal local sign-in page instead." = "本机免密登录暂时不可用，ChatCockpit 已改为打开普通本机登录页。";
"Opening Local Cockpit from this App uses a single-use loopback login grant when the console administrator is configured. The grant expires quickly, is never persisted in browser storage, and does not weaken public authentication." = "已配置控制台管理员时，从此 App 打开本机控制台会使用一次性回环登录凭据。该凭据会快速过期，不会写入浏览器持久存储，也不会降低公网访问的认证强度。";
