"ChatCockpit only reports connector binaries that it can confirm through fixed version probes. A detected binary does not mean a public route is configured or running. Public reachability remains authoritative in Web Cockpit Public Access and the Runtime projection." = "这里只显示 ChatCockpit 能通过固定版本探测确认的本机接入组件。检测到二进制并不代表公网路由已经配置或正在运行；公网可达性仍以 Web Cockpit「公网接入」与 Runtime 投影为准。";
