"Upgrade Cloudflare Tunnel?" = "升级 Cloudflare Tunnel？";
"Uninstall Cloudflare Tunnel?" = "卸载 Cloudflare Tunnel？";
"This changes only the cloudflared binary managed by ChatCockpit through Homebrew. It does not sign in to Cloudflare, install or start a tunnel service, create a tunnel, or change the current Public Access route." = "此操作只会通过 Homebrew 修改由 ChatCockpit 管理的 cloudflared 二进制；不会登录 Cloudflare、安装或启动 Tunnel Service、创建 Tunnel，也不会修改当前「公网接入」Route。";
"This cloudflared installation was detected outside ChatCockpit. It will be reused as-is and will not be upgraded or uninstalled by ChatCockpit." = "检测到的 cloudflared 并非由 ChatCockpit 安装。ChatCockpit 会按现状复用它，不会接管其升级或卸载。";
"Managed Cloudflare Tunnel installation requires Homebrew on this Mac. ChatCockpit will not install Homebrew automatically." = "由 ChatCockpit 管理 Cloudflare Tunnel 二进制需要此 Mac 已安装 Homebrew；ChatCockpit 不会自动安装 Homebrew。";
"Cloudflare Tunnel management status is not available." = "暂时无法读取 Cloudflare Tunnel 的管理状态。";
"Verified Public Route Bootstrap" = "已验证首次公网 Route";
"Local-only" = "仅本机";
"Proof expires" = "Proof 过期时间";
"Establish Public Route" = "建立公网 Route";
"Establish verified Public Route?" = "建立已验证的公网 Route？";
"ChatCockpit will establish %@ as the first canonical Public Route. If the Runtime is running, it may restart and must pass post-bootstrap verification. If restart or verification fails, ChatCockpit restores local-only mode. A stopped Runtime is never started automatically." = "ChatCockpit 将把 %@ 建立为首个 Canonical Public Route。如果 Runtime 正在运行，服务可能会重启，并且必须通过 Bootstrap 后验证；若重启或验证失败，ChatCockpit 会恢复为仅本机模式。已停止的 Runtime 绝不会被自动启动。";
"This executes only the exact verified Bootstrap Proof prepared in Web Cockpit. Running Runtime services may restart; stopped services are never started automatically. Failed restart or post-bootstrap verification triggers rollback to local-only mode." = "这里只执行 Web Cockpit 中准备好的精确已验证 Bootstrap Proof。正在运行的 Runtime 可能重启；已停止的服务绝不会自动启动。重启或 Bootstrap 后验证失败时，会回滚到仅本机模式。";
"The pending Public Route Bootstrap Proof did not satisfy the ChatCockpit machine safety contract." = "待执行的公网 Route Bootstrap Proof 不符合 ChatCockpit 机器安全合同，已拒绝执行。";
"First Public Route was established, the running Runtime restarted, and the canonical route passed post-bootstrap verification." = "首个公网 Route 已建立，正在运行的 Runtime 已重启，Canonical Route 已通过 Bootstrap 后验证。";
"First Public Route configuration was established while the Runtime remained stopped. Start ChatCockpit explicitly to complete post-bootstrap verification." = "首个公网 Route 配置已建立，但 Runtime 保持停止。请显式启动 ChatCockpit 后再完成 Bootstrap 后验证。";
"The Runtime could not restart with the first Public Route, so ChatCockpit restored local-only mode." = "Runtime 无法使用首个公网 Route 正常重启，ChatCockpit 已恢复为仅本机模式。";
"The first Public Route failed post-bootstrap verification, so ChatCockpit restored local-only mode." = "首个公网 Route 未通过 Bootstrap 后验证，ChatCockpit 已恢复为仅本机模式。";
"Public Route bootstrap rollback could not be completed automatically. Review Runtime and Public Access status before making another change." = "公网 Route Bootstrap 自动回滚未能完整完成。继续修改前，请先检查 Runtime 与「公网接入」状态。";
"The Public Route Bootstrap could not be executed by the local ChatCockpit Machine Authority." = "本机 ChatCockpit Machine Authority 无法执行此次公网 Route Bootstrap。";
"Verified Public Route Cutover" = "已验证公网 Route 切换";
"Pending Machine execution" = "等待本机执行";
"Current canonical" = "当前 Canonical";
"Verified candidate" = "已验证候选";
"Intent expires" = "Intent 过期时间";
"Apply verified Public Route?" = "应用已验证的公网 Route？";
"Apply Public Route" = "应用公网 Route";
"ChatCockpit will change the canonical Public Route from %@ to %@. If the Runtime is running, it may restart and must pass post-cutover verification. If verification or restart fails, ChatCockpit restores the previous route. A stopped Runtime is never started automatically." = "ChatCockpit 将把 Canonical Public Route 从 %@ 切换到 %@。如果 Runtime 正在运行，服务可能会重启，并且新 Route 必须通过切换后验证；若重启或验证失败，ChatCockpit 会恢复之前的 Route。已停止的 Runtime 绝不会被自动启动。";
"This executes only the exact verified Cutover Intent prepared in Web Cockpit. Running Runtime services may restart; stopped services are never started automatically. Failed restart or post-cutover verification triggers rollback to the previous canonical route." = "这里只执行 Web Cockpit 中准备好的、与精确 Verification Artifact 绑定的 Cutover Intent。正在运行的 Runtime 可能重启；已停止的服务绝不会自动启动。重启或切换后验证失败时，会回滚到之前的 Canonical Route。";
"The pending Public Route Cutover Intent did not satisfy the ChatCockpit machine safety contract." = "待执行的公网 Route Cutover Intent 不符合 ChatCockpit 机器安全合同，已拒绝执行。";
"Public Route was updated, the running Runtime restarted, and the new canonical route passed post-cutover verification." = "公网 Route 已更新，正在运行的 Runtime 已重启，新 Canonical Route 已通过切换后验证。";
"Public Route configuration was updated while the Runtime remained stopped. Start ChatCockpit explicitly to complete post-cutover verification." = "公网 Route 配置已更新，但 Runtime 保持停止。请显式启动 ChatCockpit 后再完成切换后验证。";
"The Runtime could not restart with the candidate Public Route, so ChatCockpit restored the previous canonical route." = "Runtime 无法使用候选公网 Route 正常重启，ChatCockpit 已恢复之前的 Canonical Route。";
"The candidate Public Route failed post-cutover verification, so ChatCockpit restored the previous canonical route." = "候选公网 Route 未通过切换后验证，ChatCockpit 已恢复之前的 Canonical Route。";
"Public Route rollback could not be completed automatically. Review Runtime and Public Access status before making another change." = "公网 Route 自动回滚未能完整完成。继续修改前，请先检查 Runtime 与「公网接入」状态。";
"The Public Route Cutover could not be executed by the local ChatCockpit Machine Authority." = "本机 ChatCockpit Machine Authority 无法执行此次公网 Route 切换。";
"The prepared provider action did not satisfy the ChatCockpit machine safety contract." = "准备好的 Provider 操作不符合 ChatCockpit 的机器安全合同，已拒绝执行。";
"The Homebrew provider action failed. The current Public Access route was not changed." = "Homebrew Provider 操作失败；当前「公网接入」Route 未被修改。";
"The provider action completed but the resulting cloudflared state could not be verified. The current Public Access route was not changed." = "Provider 操作已结束，但无法验证最终 cloudflared 状态；当前「公网接入」Route 未被修改。";
"Cloudflare Tunnel was installed and re-verified. No tunnel or public route was started." = "Cloudflare Tunnel 已安装并重新验证；未启动任何 Tunnel 或公网 Route。";
"Cloudflare Tunnel was upgraded and re-verified. No tunnel or public route was changed." = "Cloudflare Tunnel 已升级并重新验证；未修改任何 Tunnel 或公网 Route。";
"The ChatCockpit-managed Cloudflare Tunnel binary was uninstalled and re-verified. The current Public Access route was not changed." = "由 ChatCockpit 管理的 Cloudflare Tunnel 二进制已卸载并重新验证；当前「公网接入」Route 未被修改。";
"The Cloudflare Tunnel machine action could not be completed." = "无法完成 Cloudflare Tunnel 机器操作。";
